<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="description" content="Download your YouTube videos as MP3 or MP4 files for free with one of the fastest and most powerful YouTube to MP3 converters available."><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>YTMP3 - Free YouTube to MP3 Converter</title><link rel="canonical" href="https://yt2mp3.sc/"><style>body{background-color:#0e0f13;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;margin:0;}input, button{font-family:Arial, sans-serif;}.header{max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding-top:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;}.header a{color:#f5f6f8;text-decoration:none;margin-right:16px;}.header a:last-child{margin-right:0;}form{background-color:#16181f;max-width:600px;border-radius:10px;margin:32px auto 0 auto;}.form__formats{display:flex;}.form__formats button{color:#a8abb4;background-color:#1f2229;width:50%;height:48px;font-size:14px;border:none;border-top:3px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;box-sizing:border-box;}.form__formats button:disabled{color:#4a4d56;}.form__formats button.active{color:#ffffff;background-color:#16181f;border-top:3px solid #3b82f6;}.form__formats button.active:disabled{color:#6b6e78;border-top-color:#2a3a52;}.form__formats .mp3{border-top-left-radius:10px;}.form__formats .mp4{border-top-right-radius:10px;}.form__body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:24px;}.form__title label{color:#f5f6f8;font-size:14px;line-height:14px;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;display:block;}.form__body input, .form__body button{font-size:16px;width:100%;height:48px;border-radius:6px;}.form__body input{color:#c9ccd3;background-color:#0b0c10;border:1px solid #2a2d36;padding:0 12px;box-sizing:border-box;outline:none;}.form__body button{color:#ffffff;background-color:#3b82f6;border:none;padding:0;cursor:pointer;}.form__input--progress{color:#6b6e78;background-color:#0b0c10;font-size:16px;width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid #2a2d36;border-radius:6px;padding:0 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;justify-content:left;box-sizing:border-box;}.form__actions--download{display:flex;gap:12px;}.form__actions--download button{font-size:16px;flex:1;height:48px;border-radius:6px;padding:0;}.form__actions--download .download{color:#ffffff;background-color:#3b82f6;cursor:pointer;}.form__actions--download .download:disabled{color:#6b8fc7;background-color:#1a3a6b;cursor:not-allowed;}.form__actions--download .reset{color:#a8abb4;background-color:transparent;border:1px #2a2d36 solid;box-sizing:border-box;cursor:pointer;}.form__actions--download .reset:disabled{color:#4a4d56;cursor:not-allowed;}.form__error--title{color:#a8aab4;font-size:14px;line-height:14px;}.form__error--message{color:#6b6e78;background-color:#0b0c10;font-size:16px;line-height:48px;height:48px;border:1px solid #2a2d36;border-radius:6px;padding:0 12px;box-sizing:border-box;}.form__error--button button{color:#ffffff;background-color:#3b82f6;border:none;}.form__loader{width:16px;height:16px;border:2px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);border-top-color:#3b82f6;border-radius:50%;animation:spin 0.8s linear infinite;}@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}.text{color:#a8abb4;max-width:600px;margin:48px auto 0 auto;}.text h1{color:#f5f6f8;font-size:22px;font-weight:normal;line-height:22px;margin:0;}.text p{line-height:24px;margin:16px 0 0 0;}.text ol{list-style-position:inside;margin:16px 0;padding-left:0;}.text li{line-height:24px;margin-bottom:8px;}.text li:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}.text a{color:#a8abb4;}.footer{text-align:center;max-width:600px;border-top:1px #1a1c22 solid;margin:64px auto 0 auto;padding:24px 0;}.footer a{color:#7e8189;text-decoration:none;margin:0 8px;}@media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {.header{margin:0 4%;}.header a:nth-of-type(3), .header a:nth-of-type(4){display:none;}form{margin:32px 4% 0 4%;}.text{margin:48px 4% 0 4%;}.footer{margin:64px 4% 0 4%;}}</style></head><body><div class="header"><div><img src="/svg/1778492455/logo.svg" width="177" height="40" alt="YTMP3"></div><div><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/faq/">FAQ</a><a href="/add-on/">Add-On</a><a href="/bookmarklet/">Bookmarklet</a></div></div><form autocomplete="off" method="post"><div class="form__formats"><button type="button" class="mp3 active">MP3</button><button type="button" class="mp4">MP4</button></div><div class="form__body"><div class="form__title"><label for="video">Insert a YouTube video URL</label></div><div class="form__input"><input id="video" type="text" name="video" placeholder="youtube.com/watch?v=yTmP3-20_26" autofocus required></div><div class="form__actions"><button type="submit">Convert</button></div></div></form><div class="text"><h1>YouTube to MP3 Converter</h1><p>YTMP3 is your go-to tool for downloading YouTube videos as MP3 or MP4 files. The service is completely free of charge and does not require any registration or additional software. YTMP3 is optimized to work seamlessly on computers, mobile phones, and tablets.</p><p>Another major advantage of our YouTube to MP3 converter is faster conversion times and safe file downloads compared to our competitors. This is possible because YTMP3 runs on its own self-developed software and does not rely on any third-party APIs or external software.</p><p>By using YTMP3, you accept our <a href="/terms-of-use/">Terms of Use</a>.</p><p>How to download a YouTube video?</p><ol><li>Go to YouTube and search for a video you would like to download. Copy the video URL from your browser's address bar. Please note: A valid video URL has the following format: youtube.com/watch?v=videoId</li><li>Paste the video URL into our converter above and select a download format. You can choose between MP3 or MP4. If no format is selected, the video will be converted to an MP3 file by default. Click the &bdquo;Convert&rdquo; button.</li><li>The conversion process will start. Depending on the length of the video, this may take some time. Once the conversion is finished successfully, you can download the converted file by clicking the &bdquo;Download&rdquo; button.</li></ol><p>Thank you for using our YouTube to MP3 Converter.</p></div><div class="footer"><a href="/contact/">Contact</a><a href="/copyright-claims/">Copyright Claims</a><a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms-of-use/">ToU</a></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebSite","name":"YTMP3","alternateName":["YouTube MP3","YouTube to MP3","YouTube to MP3 Converter","YouTube Converter","YouTube Downloader","yt2mp3.sc"],"url":"https://yt2mp3.sc/"}</script><script>var gS = false;var json = JSON.parse('[[95,56,70,78,91,105,93,81,124,125,82,128,112,55,74,126,59,120,81,53,79,114,122,125,90,103,86,130,135,97,130,80,129,67,74,119,94,76,71,69,106,91,120,118,105,56],0,[7,4,15,14,11,0,1,14,9,9,6,1,16,10,14,8,16,13,13,2,1,7,9,0,15,7,1,10,12,4,11,1,4,4,9,13,6,11,12,3,3,6,4,3,4,12],0,5,2,122]');</script><script src="/js/1778492455/ytmp3.js" defer></script></body></html>